OL,3,GNEWSANurses speak out against rising
OL,4,Atide of abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FAware of issues faced by its staff,
OL,7,FSouth Tyneside and Sunderland NHS
OL,8,FFoundation Trust (STSFT) said it had
OL,9,Fset up a dedicated team to address the
OL,10,Fincreasing levels of abuse its staff
OL,11,Ffaced.
